(card "exp:C7_same_minute_pre_amt" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:C7_same_minute_pre_amt"
  :body "---\nnav: 21\ntype: experiment\nid: C7_same_minute_pre_amt\nshort_name: same_minute_pre_amt\ntitle: \"C7 — same-minute pre_amt impact (Team A top-3 reference)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: a\nround: r3\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: null\ntrain_nav: 2.2416\ntrain_trade_count: 140\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8643\ntrain_sharpe: 7.6801\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.06\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0027\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.27\ntest_trade_count: 20\ntest_sharpe: 7.92\ntest_win_rate: 0.8\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0038\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: test_marginal\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [microstructure, sizing]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/a, round/r3, axis/microstructure, axis/sizing, status/challenger, outcome/test_marginal, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# C7 — same-minute pre_amt impact\n\n> **TL;DR** —— Team A C7 候选: 用 trigger 同 minute 内的 pre_trigger amount 作 impact-aware ranker. train NAV 2.24 marginal +0.05 vs anchor; **test NAV 1.27 vs anchor 1.25, +0.02 marginal**. 是 Team A 整个 impact-aware 路线中 test 表现最好的一档.\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：同 minute 内 pre_amt 反映\"当前 minute trigger 强度\"，比 trigger time 离散 impact 更精确。\n- 期待: marginal NAV gain + 更稳 sharpe.\n- 实测：marginal +0.02 test NAV — 信号确实正向但弱.\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`team_a/scripts/round_3_runner.py`\n- 步骤: anchor base + same-minute pre_amt impact rank.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- pre_amt is past-only (trigger 前 5min). `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.2416 | 140 | 7.68 | 86.4% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.06 ± 0.003 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.27 | 20 | 7.92 | 80.0% | -0.38% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | +0.022 | 0 | +0.77 | +5.0pp | +0.15pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0.\n- marginal gain, 在 noise 边缘.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **Team A top picks**: [[arc_260516a__team_a__C20__recent_signal_flow_skip]], [[arc_260516a__team_a__C6__anchor_plus_impact_cap]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_a/output/cross_round_leaderboard.csv` (C7 row)\n- `cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (C7 test 1.27)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- Team A \"impact-aware ranker\" 路线整体在 test 上 marginal positive but no big gains. 是 niche 优化, NAV 主战场已被 H/C 占据.\n- 与 C8.4 (Team C) 比, Team A 路线缺 top-3 expand —— 这条 lesson 未来 ranker 实验应吸收.\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_a__C7__same_minute_pre_amt.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:31:14+08:00"
  :ingested_at "2026-05-21T01:29:42+08:00")

